<view class="read-page theme-{{theme}}" style="padding-top: {{navHeight + 18}}px;">
  <view class="utility-heading"><button class="nav-back" bindtap="goBack" aria-label="返回"><ki-icon name="arrow-left" size="22" /></button><view class="utility-heading-content"><strong>先听一遍，再把句子读出来</strong><text>已完成 {{readingSessions}} 次朗读练习。这里只记录练习和感受，不自动评判对错；录音为选做。</text></view></view>

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="read-loading"><view class="skeleton"></view></view>
  <view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="read-empty">{{error}}</view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="read-lesson-picker">
      <button class="{{lessonIndexValue === 0 ? 'disabled' : ''}}" data-offset="-1" bindtap="stepLesson" aria-label="上一课"><ki-icon name="chevron-right" size="18" class="reader-icon-left" /></button>
      <picker mode="selector" range="{{lessonOptions}}" range-key="label" value="{{lessonIndexValue}}" bindchange="chooseLesson">
        <view class="lesson-select"><text>选择朗读课次</text><strong>第 {{lesson.position}} 课 · {{lesson.title}}</strong></view>
      </picker>
      <text class="read-lesson-position">第 {{lesson.position}} 课</text>
      <button class="{{lessonIndexValue === lessonOptions.length - 1 ? 'disabled' : ''}}" data-offset="1" bindtap="stepLesson" aria-label="下一课"><ki-icon name="chevron-right" size="18" /></button>
    </view>

    <view class="read-studio">
      <view class="read-mascot"><text>读</text></view>
      <view class="studio-copy"><text>跟读小任务</text><strong>{{lesson.title}}</strong><view>先听范读，再自己大声读一遍；不需要录音也能完成练习。</view></view>
      <view class="record-launch press-card" bindtap="markRead" role="button" hover-class="is-pressed"><ki-icon name="check" size="19" />我已经大声读了一遍</view>
    </view>

    <view class="sentence-list">
      <view class="sentence-card {{speaking ? 'speaking' : ''}}" hover-class="is-pressed">
        <text>“{{lesson.context}}”</text>
        <view class="sentence-action press-card" bindtap="previewSentence" role="button" hover-class="is-pressed"><ki-icon name="sound" size="19" />{{speaking ? '正在范读…' : '范读'}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="reading-reflection {{readingReflection ? 'is-recorded' : ''}}">
      <view class="result-mark" aria-label="朗读练习"><ki-icon name="check" size="18" /></view>
      <view class="reflection-copy"><strong>{{readingReflection === 'comfortable' ? '这次读得比较顺' : (readingReflection === 'needs-practice' ? '已经记下还想再练' : '读完后，记下这次的感受')}}</strong><text>这不是对错评分，只帮助你决定要不要再听、再读一遍。</text></view>
      <view wx:if="{{readyToReflect}}" class="reflection-actions"><button data-reflection="comfortable" bindtap="reflect">读得比较顺</button><button class="ghost" data-reflection="needs-practice" bindtap="reflect">有几个字还不熟</button></view>
      <button wx:else class="reflection-again" bindtap="markRead">{{readingReflection ? '再读一遍' : '我读完了'}}</button>
    </view>

    <view class="optional-recording">
      <view><text>选做 · 听见自己的变化</text><strong>想回听时，再录下来</strong><view>录音只用于自己回听，不参与课程通关，也不判断读得对不对。</view></view>
      <view class="record-toggle press-card {{recording ? 'recording' : ''}}" bindtap="toggleRecording" role="button" hover-class="is-pressed"><ki-icon name="{{recording ? 'stop-circle' : 'microphone'}}" size="19" />{{recording ? '结束录音' : '开始录音（选做）'}}</view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{tempFilePath}}" class="recording-result">
      <view class="result-mark" aria-label="录音完成"><ki-icon name="check" size="18" /></view>
      <view><strong>{{cloudSaving ? '正在保存录音…' : '录音已经准备好'}}</strong><text>{{cloudStatus ? cloudStatus : '回听时只和刚才的自己比较，不需要给对错分数。'}}</text></view>
      <button class="play-recording" bindtap="playRecording">{{playing ? '停止回听' : '回听录音'}} · {{durationText}}</button>
    </view>
  </block>
  <bottom-navigation active="practice" theme="{{theme}}" />
</view>
